CowSwapModuleFactory_Constructor
├── when cowSettlement is zero address
│   └── it should revert with CowSwapModuleFactory_ZeroCowSettlement
├── when cowSettlement has no code
│   └── it should revert with CowSwapModuleFactory_SettlementNotContract
└── when cowSettlement is a valid contract
    ├── it should set cowSettlement
    ├── it should set sequencerUptimeFeed
    └── it should set sequencerGracePeriod
